@startuml scenario-PQA-2
!include plantuml-theme.puml
left to right direction
hide stereotype
title Quality attribute scenario — PQA-2 — Performance efficiency / resource utilisation
rectangle "<b>Source of stimulus</b>\nAccount owner (cost review)" as SRC #E7E3F3
rectangle "<b>Stimulus</b>\nMonthly review of provisioned versus used capacity" as STIM #E7E3F3
rectangle "<b>Artifact</b>\nECS tasks and managed data services" as ART #EDF2F8
rectangle "<b>Response</b>\nOver-provisioned resources are identified and right-sized" as RESP #E4F0E9
rectangle "<b>Response measure</b>\nProposed — confirm: average CPU utilisation ≥ 40 % on tasks and data nodes, or a documented reason why not" as MEAS #E4F0E9
rectangle "<b>Environment</b>\nNormal (low) demonstration load" as ENV #F5EEE3
SRC  --> STIM : generates
STIM --> ART  : arrives at
ART  --> RESP : produces
RESP --> MEAS : measured by
ENV  ..> ART
@enduml
